{"about_the_game":"<strong>El Paso, Elsewhere</strong> is a supernatural neo-noir third-person shooter. Hunt werewolves, fallen angels, and other damned creatures in a vivid slow motion love letter to action classics. Fight your way through a reality-shifting motel, floor by bloody floor. Save the victims of Draculae, lord of the vampires. Destroy the villain you loved--even if it means dying yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/a4387bd16eab84425c910e867de9aa3e.poster.avif?t=1745355712\" width=540 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/a4387bd16eab84425c910e867de9aa3e.webm?t=1745355712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/a4387bd16eab84425c910e867de9aa3e.mp4?t=1745355712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Somewhere in El Paso, Texas, a three-story motel gained another 46 stories... all below ground.<br>So, yeah.<br>This is going to get loud.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Original hip-hop soundtrack.<br></li><li> Molotov cocktails filled with holy blue flame.<br></li><li> A fully-voiced neo-noir story campaign set in a reality-shifting motel full of monsters.<br></li><li> Hordes of destructible physics objects; for shooting.<br></li><li> More slow-motion dives than you would think it is humanly possible to fit into a single video game.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/8dab81abe101ed83faecdbb84e0dfb0c.poster.avif?t=1745355712\" width=540 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/8dab81abe101ed83faecdbb84e0dfb0c.webm?t=1745355712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1546310/extras/8dab81abe101ed83faecdbb84e0dfb0c.mp4?t=1745355712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FAITHFUL LISTENER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"FLASHBACK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"GOODBYE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"BURIAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"SCARS FADE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"THANKS FOR BELIEVING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"OLD CLASSIC","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"LIFTOFF","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"HIGH STAKES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"},{"name":"SPRING LOADED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1546310/42ef105156d32c51077915152250bde780713cbe.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1546310?t=1745355712","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa